WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Narrator: Five tips for directions that work.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:07.300
Narrator: Stand beside the fan so you both face the way to go.

3
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Narrator: Point with an open hand.

4
00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:15.000
Narrator: Use landmarks and time, not metres - past the blue kiosk, about three minutes.

5
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:20.700
Narrator: Give left and right from the fan's side, and keep it to three steps or fewer.

6
00:00:20.900 --> 00:00:23.400
Narrator: Then check they've got it.

